claim.claim-text:
receiving a penetrative scan of a patient's teeth including attachments bonded thereto;
identifying attachments from the penetrative scan;
analyzing the attachments to confirm that they are within an acceptable tolerance of a clinical treatment plan; and
outputting, to a user, an indication of the status of the attachments.

receiving a penetrative scan of a patient's teeth including attachments bonded thereto;
identifying attachments from the penetrative scan;
analyzing the attachment to confirm that they are within an acceptable tolerance of a clinical treatment plan;
analyzing the attachments to determine if they have a defect; and
outputting, to a user, an indication of the status of the attachments.
